{
  "$schema": "https://openapi.vercel.sh/vercel.json",
  "outputDirectory": "builds/web",
  "headers": [
    {
      "source": "/(.*)",
      "headers": [
        {
          "key": "Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy",
          "value": "same-origin"
        },
        {
          "key": "Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy",
          "value": "require-corp"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "/(.*).wasm",
      "headers": [
        {
          "key": "Content-Type",
          "value": "application/wasm"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "/(.*).pck",
      "headers": [
        {
          "key": "Content-Type",
          "value": "application/octet-stream"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "/(.*).(wasm|pck|js)",
      "headers": [
        {
          "key": "Cache-Control",
          "value": "public, max-age=31536000, immutable"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "_nota": "Os dois cabecalhos Cross-Origin sao exigencia do navegador para liberar SharedArrayBuffer, e sem SharedArrayBuffer a build com threads do Godot nao inicia. Com eles, o motor sai de uma linha de execucao so e passa a usar os nucleos do aparelho."
}